title Vinyl Knock-knock: the Menu where the launcher answers screen: the Knock-knock row in TOOLS, under the Sleep timer (Off); a tap turns it On, Enter Off again; the Playback page has no such row (480x320 and 320x480 at their real density)
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 630
# the 3.5-inch panel's 6.3 px/mm (the owner's rule R-4)
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE menu
env VINYL_DEMO_SCREEN 1

wait 900
shot 01-menu-knock-off
expect text "Knock-knock"
expect text "Sleep timer"
# P2d (owner, 2026-11-17): the grey line of help under the row, wrapped where narrow
expect text "Tap the cover 3 times to turn the screen off. Tap 3 times anywhere to wake it."
tap "Knock-knock"
wait 400
shot 02-menu-knock-on
key enter
wait 400
shot 03-menu-knock-off-again
tap "Playback"
wait 400
shot 04-playback-no-row
expect text "Gapless"
expect notext "Knock-knock"
expect notext "Tap the cover 3 times to turn the screen off. Tap 3 times anywhere to wake it."
expect noquit
